factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 4 problems
  The reel_script says the complainants met the collector and filed the petition, but the article says the petition was filed with Collector Madhubalan; this is consistent. However, the reel_script says the complaint was against 'officials' being made to stand, and the article says officials treat them 'as if they were hardened criminals'; the phrase 'குற்றவாளிகளைப் போல நடத்துவதாகவும்' is accurate. Main issue: the reel_script and slides say 'நிற்க வைத்துப் பேசுவதாக' (making them stand and talk), which matches the article's 'நிற்க வைத்து'; no clear factual error found there.
  The reel_script says 'பள்ளிப்பாளையத்தில் பள்ளி மேலாண்மை குழு நிர்வாகிகள் அவமரியாதை செய்வதாகக் கலெக்டரிடம் புகார் மனு அளித்துள்ளனர்' – the article says the complaint was about officials at the block education office, not that the committee members were disrespected in Pallipalayam generally; the location framing is slightly imprecise.
  The caption says 'நேற்றும் அலட்சியமாகப் பேசி அவமரியாதை செய்ததாகக் கூறினார்' which is accurate, but the caption's headline calls it 'அவமரியாதை செய்வதாக' attributed to unspecified parties, and the slides say 'நேற்றும் இதே போல நடந்ததாகத் தெரிவிப்பு' which adds 'இதே போல' (same way), a comparison not stated in the article.
  The reel_script omits the detail that the block education office is located inside the school campus (the article says the office is in the school's campus), an important context fact.
