  The reel_script says the MP 'குற்றம் சாட்டினார்' (accused) and the caption/headline frame it as an accusation; the article presents these as the MP's statements to reporters, which is acceptable, but the draft's slide 2 line 'ஜிஎஸ்டி தமிழகத்தில் எந்த அளவுக்கு குறைந்தது என மக்கள்' is an incomplete clause that does not carry a clear meaning in Tamil.
  The slides_spec line 'கடந்த 6 மாதங்களாக தவெக ஆட்சி நடைபெறுகிறது' presents the 6-month period as the MP's claim about the ruling government, which is consistent with the article, but the slide omits that the MP criticised the government as only 'சாலைவலம்' with no progress, which the reel conveys; no factual error here.
